# 🔐 25. DATA VALIDATION

Before a state is saved, the Game Manager should validate important data.

Examples:

```text
Hero Level cannot be negative.

Hero EXP cannot be negative.

Master Level cannot be negative.

Floor Progress cannot exceed unlocked content.

Inventory quantity cannot be negative.

Relationship values must remain within valid limits.

Destruction Level must remain within defined limits.
```

Example:

```text
INVALID

Hero HP = -500

        ↓

VALIDATION

        ↓

Correct / Reject State
```

