# ✨ FINAL PRINCIPLE

> **Core World Building defines what Aetheria is.**

> **Game Systems define what the player can do.**

> **Game Manager System coordinates those systems.**

> **Game State System records what has happened.**

> **World Simulation determines what happens next.**

Therefore:

```text
CORE WORLD
     ↓
GAME MANAGER
     ↓
GAME STATE
     ↓
PLAYER ACTION
     ↓
SYSTEM PROCESSING
     ↓
EVENT
     ↓
CONSEQUENCE
     ↓
WORLD STATE CHANGE
     ↓
NEW WORLD
```

Aetheria should not behave like a static RPG map.

It should behave like a **persistent fantasy world that remembers what the Master has done.**
